"P856364347" ""
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1695114436" "You want to know what's going on here? I'll tell you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P61316539" "PTS Worker"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2191927935" "If you want to know what's going on, talk to the foreman. I'm out of here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P920652706" "You found the information you needed to know."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3659074126" "That this power drop from the PTS should co-incide with the Circle's attack would be enough, even without the words of the Foreman and that fool Circle Sorcerer. This confirms what they've done. They must have known that I was close, and that with your aid we could succeed, and so were moved to rash action. Action we can take advantage of. But first, we must deal with some of the others who will have noticed what the Circle has done before they become a problem. Our moment of victory comes, but we must first clear the way."
// RandomFameString :
"P1069247325" "The power's been going in and out all day! What's going on?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1683702963" "That you have dedicated your dark heart to my endeavor seems to have forced the Circle's hand. This will actually help our plan in the long term, but the action they have taken was so blatant that even the pathetic dabblers in the Legacy Chain will have noticed. We must stop them from learning enough to be a threat to our plans. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>To prevent this, I am sending you to retreive a book they would need to stop us, for it contains Information they would need to find what the Circle has taken.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2728976746" "Take book from Legacy Chain"
// SendOffString :
"P1015809096" "The book in question is a translation of the journal of one Padre Henri. It could be quite informative for you to peruse. Taking the book from the Legacy Chain should put an end to their interference in the plan. You will also need to deal with the leader of the investigation. He knows too much already, and must be removed from the game board."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3756410339" "Take book & stop investigator"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2635535057" "Padre Henri's journal is vital to the Legacy Chain. They are sure to defend it well. Don't let that stop you. We are getting very close indeed."

