// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Safe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2252294519" "Safe"
// Description :
"P3525668165" "Take Journal"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2722022965" "You begin opening the safe"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P721809999" "You have opened the safe"
// InteractActionString :
"P1143515829" "Opening..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2974894735" "You found something"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1664474898" "You got the Journal of Padre Henri"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3854416603" "Toddsworth told you I would betray you? Preposterous! I have no plans of the kind. I need your power, your skills, and your willing participation to complete this. I have my plan and I know my abilities, but I would not dare to cross those with such power and demonstrated viciousness. Toddsworth was just making a poor final attempt to insert doubts that would stop our plans. And they must be our plans, now, you have earned it. If you have read the Journal, then you already know much. I will do as I can to clarify the rest so that you will understand your next task."
// RandomFameString :
"P2595506566" "First the power goes down, and now I think I heard the Volcano rumbling. I gotta move out of here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2371483499" "It is now time that you learned the truth of this enterprise. I have promised power and the riches of the world to you, but have not told you how this would be acheived. If you've read Henri's Journal, then you probably are beginning to understand, but I will clarify. When Father Henri came to this island, he discovered that the Cultists living here had summoned a great beast of the netherworld in their desperation. It was bound within the volcano, and Henri siezed on this. He bound it tighter, and trapped it within the mountain, where it lay until now. Dr. Aeon's geothermal experiments accidentally began to tap the fiend for power, and began to weaken Henri's seals. Now it approaches freedom, but is still weak enough to be re-bound or threatened with it. I seek to bind this beast, this Bat'Zul, to my will. The Circle seeks the same. And no doubt the Legacy Chain seek to imprison it with the best seals they can manage. With the beast properly bound, not even Lord Recluse will be able to stand against it's power. And that is the power I promise you a share of. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>But first, we must find out what the Circle has done and prevent them from gaining control of Bat'Zul.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2915623918" "Discover the Circle's plans for Bat'Zul"
// SendOffString :
"P2917051832" "As you are aware, Aeon's power system truly draws it's power from Bat'Zul and the spells imprisoning him. The drop in power could only occur if the Circle has somehow interfered with the spells, or with Bat'Zul. My portal is ready, and I will send you through it to a section of the Circle's hidden city. Discover there what they have done with the fiend we will control."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P649895734" "Find Circle plan with Bat'Zul"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3862588290" "Once we know what the Circle has planned, we can thwart their works and take Bat'Zul's power for our own."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4132788123" "Perhaps it's the mystical power flowing through this place, but you feel as though a thousand eyes are watching you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P414608431" "Sealing a beast of that power is truly draining.<em>Not as powerful, but far more portable. <em>Yes, and Bat'Zul even comes with it's own prison."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2248680447" "I agree. <em>And this one isn't even as powerful as Mot. <em>True. We had to engineer the destruction of a civilization for that one."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2087456712" "An intruder? But how?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3662419314" "Did you feel that? <em>There was a surge in our portals. <em>I know. I'm going to check it out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3473347394" "Feel what?<em>The network's been stable since we pushed the Rikti from the City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1137315329" "Ah. And that would be our distubance, wouldn't it?"

